      "role": "user",
      "content": "Wait, what are you talking about with \"gobbling up\" data and \"confused elves\"? I'm just looking for a technical explanation of the network lag. Is there an actual issue with the records, or are you just using weird metaphors?",
      "source": "evaluator"
